{"version":1,"content":"<p>歌手譚嘉儀（Kayee）早前於峇里島舉行一場充滿浪漫氣氛的夢幻婚禮，於晚宴進場環節，譚嘉儀以一首全新創作歌曲《You and Me》驚喜獻上比老公。</p><p>這首歌由她親自填詞、作曲及監製，從靈感、旋律到製作皆一手包辦。</p><p>歌曲以婚禮為背景，細膩表達對另</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T11:23:55.040814+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T11:07:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T11:17:13.104195+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T11:17:13.104195+00:00","content_hash":"214fade42f3f180eea6c2b276745339cd1366f4c31d3de1a7fd16115fb9c1432","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}